  "design": {
    "idea": "Deepened Brass Mirror & Portal Gallery (D06 8-tile un-zippable chasm): unlock Key Door #2, bank off Mirror A to power the Blue Portal across the 128px chasm, warp to the east island, rotate Mirror B to 45 deg on the brass focus mark, and fire ONE Prism-Split 3-ray fan hitting all three east eyes simultaneously \u2014 extending the 128px bridge AND opening both Belfry (r8) and Upper Tide Hub (r15)!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Portal crossing combined with exact focal-distance Prism Split aiming across three simultaneous targets.",
    "decisions": 9,
    "expert_s": 54,
